\fs36 \cf0 Two scripts to store, and then later retrieve, tags to a track's file's "Get Info" comments. Optionally, you can also store 
\f1\b Playlist
\f0\b0  names the track appears in, and later restore the track to those playlists.\
\pard\tx160\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\li200\fi-20\ql\qnatural

